Z||000000||Haze_Performance||08-22-2000||07:59 PM||||When mounting the Mustang Scoop on the deck, do I mount it flush with the rear of the decklid (by the window) or is it offset?<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mycarsig.jpg">  <B>My 1985 2M4 Sport Coupe </B><P><BR><B>My Website's  <A HREF="http://www.drive.to/WS6_Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>WS6 Fiero</A> &                  <A HREF="http://www.drive.to/HMP" TARGET=_blank>H.M.P. </A></B>||||reg||5
